    "caption": "We believe that one of the most underrated ice cream combinations is pistachio and strawberry. You read that right! So if you’ve had a long day, why not drop by #TheMarketplace today and grab a container of nutty Selecta Pistachio & Cashew Ice Cream, along with some fresh strawberries, for this delicious Pistachio Strawberry Sundae.\n\nGive it a boozy kick by adding a splash of orange liqueur, if you prefer! Serve with whipped cream and chopped pistachios as well for an elegant touch. Go on, you deserve this.\n\nServing Time: 30 minutes\nYield: 2 servings\n\nIngredients\n\n2 scoops Selecta Pistachio & Cashew Ice Cream\n1 cup fresh strawberries\n2 tbsps. sugar, plus more as needed\n1 tsp. lemon juice\n1 tbsp. orange liqueur, optional\nWhipped cream and chopped pistachios to serve\n\nProcedure\n\n1. Rinse strawberries and pat dry. Hull and slice into cubes.\n2. Combine strawberries, sugar, lemon juice, and orange liqueur in a saucepan over low heat. Stirring frequently, cook until thickened. Adjust sugar to taste. Transfer to a bowl and chill until completely cooled.\n3. Scoop Selecta Pistachio & Cashew Ice Cream into a serving glass. Add spoonfuls of strawberry compote. Top with whipped cream and chopped pistachios to serve.\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
