    "campaign": "TMP Anniversary",
    "caption": "Monkey Bread is a catchy and cheeky name for this baked creation;and while its origins remain unknown, it is said that the act of eating this bread — which is by tearing it with your hands and putting it inside your mouth — is similar to how a monkey would eat it, too.\n\nThis Monkey Bread comes extra cheesy (so expect a lot of cheese pulls) thanks to the full pack of Emborg Mozzarella Shredded Cheese that finds its way into the dough’s filling. Herby, delicious, and extra creamy, there’s no better way to enjoy this Cheesy Monkey Bread than with, of course, your hands.\n\nFind all the ingredients that you need for this recipe at #TheMarketplace!\n\nServing Time: 2 hours 30 minutes\nYield: 12 servings\n\nIngredients\n\nFor the dough:\n3 cups all-purpose flour\n2 tsps. instant dry yeast\n1 cup lukewarm water\n2 tsps. salt\n3 tbsps. olive oil, plus more for brushing\nExtra flour for dusting\n\nFor the filling:\n1 pack (200g) Emborg Mozzarella Shredded Cheese\n½ cup unsalted butter, softened\n4 garlic cloves, minced\n2 tbsps. fresh herbs (parsley, basil, rosemary, thyme), finely chopped\nSalt and pepper to taste\n\nProcedure\n1. Preheat oven to 180°C and brush a deep cast-iron pan with olive oil. In a small bowl, mix butter, garlic, parsley, rosemary, thyme, salt and pepper. Set aside.\n2. In a large bowl, mix flour, salt, oil, water, and yeast. Knead until smooth. Cover and proof for 1 hour.\n3. Divide dough into 12 pieces. Flatten then add herbed butter and Emborg Mozzarella Shredded Cheese. Seal and roll into balls, dusting flour as needed.\n4. Arrange in the pan, cover, and proof for 30 mins. Top with more herbed butter and mozzarella. Bake for 25-30 mins. until golden brown and cheesy. Cool on a wire rack before serving.\n\nOrder your groceries online at https://bit.ly/ShopNowGoCart. Join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber!",
